  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Robin Left A Nest On Daddy's Grave**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **On The Line - Train 45**: back after 145 archived shows (1016 days); rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n- **Mackinac Rag**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n- **Blue Mule**: rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n- **Feast Here Tonight**: rare: 7 archived performances [5]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Catch And Release [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-11-19.Capt.Greg.flac** (recommended): audience recording; 30 songs; 147 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer calls the audience recording excellent [4]\n- **billystrings2022-11-19.4mic.flac24**: source not stated; 31 songs; 152 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer attended in person with a friend and says the band played hard and tightly on every song [4]\n- This was the final US show of the band's fall 2022 tour [1]\n- Billy's new album Me and Dad had come out the day before, on Friday 18 November 2022 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-11-19.Capt.Greg.flac**: taped by Capt. Greg; transferred by Capt. Greg; source: AUD [1]. Also: Taped with the Anthem staff's permission by a small group of tapers; Andy Lytle made the mix. Total run time 2h33m32s [1]\n- **billystrings2022-11-19.4mic.flac24**: taped by Peter Del Savio; transferred by Peter Del Savio; source: (4 mic mix) Neumann KM185's + AKG461's -> Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [2]. Also: Peter Del Savio recorded and transferred it, mixing, trimming and fading in Audacity, then CDWave for track splitting and FLAC [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings The Anthem - Washington, D.C. - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/the-anthem-washington-d-c-4/) [6]\n- Poster by The Movie Database: [Billy Strings | 2022.11.19 — The Anthem - Washington, DC](https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1059365-billy-strings-2022-11-19-the-anthem-washington-dc/images/posters) [7]",
